WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.900
What is the impact of finding your WHY?

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.000
So, I can tell you what I went through

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.960
which is what set me on the journey

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:10.000
to sharing the message of the WHY

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.660
and helping people find theirs.

00:00:11.825 --> 00:00:14.600
A WHY is like a compass direction

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.800
it tells you where you're going.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.120
We can live our lives by accident

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.020
which is kind of like getting in a ship
and just sailing

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:23.700
or just getting in a car
and just driving.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:25.400
You'll absolutely see some amazing things

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.600
you'll stumble upon some amazing experiences

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.100
but you don't really have a sense of where you're going

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.423
any sort of direction.

00:00:31.423 --> 00:00:31.923
In other words

00:00:32.325 --> 00:00:33.525
what's it all for?

00:00:33.525 --> 00:00:35.500
What the WHY does is it provides a path.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.960
It provides a map or a compass.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:40.665
So you will still have some of those
amazing experiences

00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:43.135
but now they have value and worth

00:00:43.135 --> 00:00:44.300
and they're taking you towards something else

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.540
it's a journey toward something.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.725
When I learned my WHY

00:00:48.725 --> 00:00:51.815
I had a tremendous calm come over me.

00:00:51.815 --> 00:00:54.685
My confidence grew.

00:00:54.685 --> 00:00:57.645
A sense that my life had more meaning
than I thought it had before.

00:00:57.645 --> 00:01:00.475
And I had now the choice

00:01:00.475 --> 00:01:01.820
a new way of viewing decisions

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:03.000
a filter

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.000
through which to make decisions.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.840
Now I ask myself

00:01:06.165 --> 00:01:09.395
does this help advance my WHY or not?

00:01:09.425 --> 00:01:11.300
Does this help me stay on the path that
I'm supposed to be on?

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.700
Or is this going to be a random adventure?

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:17.529
So the WHY provides 
focus, direction, meaning

00:01:17.529 --> 00:01:18.805
and confidence.

00:01:28.215 --> 00:01:29.215
 

00:01:31.905 --> 00:01:32.905
 

00:01:35.545 --> 00:01:36.545
 

